-- chem/order.cub — the order of exact energies. A canonical form Σ c_ij 2^{i/8} 3^{j/8} (chem/electric.cub) is zero
-- only when every c_ij is, the radicals being linearly independent over the rationals; otherwise its sign is
-- decided by rational bounds on the radicals, refined until the interval of the sum excludes zero. The bounds are
-- exact: x/2^k ≤ a^{1/8} < (x+1)/2^k with x the largest integer whose eighth power is at most a·2^{8k}, found bit
-- by bit in binary. No real number is formed; the comparison is a finite computation on integers.
import "binary.cub"

